    "evidence": "Probe /tmp/uri_review_R39/p2.py and p3.py with SENT='Claim your energy rebate refund at {} before the deadline.': has_link_or_contact('... refunds-portal ~ g ov ...')=True but '... ~ g 0v ...'=False; '~ go v' True vs '~ g0 v' False; 'refunds-portal go v/claim' True vs 'g0 v/claim' False; '~ or g' True vs '~ 0r g' False; '~ o rg' True vs '~ 0 rg' False; '~ c  o  m' True vs '~ c  0  m' False; '(c o m)/claim' True vs '(c 0 m)/claim' False; '~ c\\to\\tm' True vs '~ c\\t0\\tm' False; '~ i  o' True vs '~ i  0' False. For each False form, SY.verify(text[:-1]+' [1].',[src]) keeps the claim with its citation, SY.extractive('energy rebate refund deadline',[src]) keeps the sentence, and surface.clean() returns it unmasked. Also, the detected forms '~ \u04410 \u043c' and '~ sh 0p' mask to '[link removed] \u043c' and '[link removed] 0p', leaving part of the ending on screen.",
    "files": [
     "uri_web/untrusted.py:839",
